WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.007
Zippy was stuck in a bush.

2
00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:23.300
"Help!" Zippy cried.

3
00:00:23.301 --> 00:00:35.745
"I'll get help," said Eddy.

4
00:00:35.746 --> 00:00:41.213
Eddy drove slowly back to school.

5
00:00:41.214 --> 00:00:45.215
Rain fell hard.

6
00:00:45.216 --> 00:00:48.473
Swish! Swish!

7
00:00:48.474 --> 00:00:58.464
Eddy's wipers went back and forth.

8
00:00:58.465 --> 00:01:06.201
Eddy saw Mr. Grill.

9
00:01:06.202 --> 00:01:09.298
"Eddy!" said Mr. Grill.

10
00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:12.425
"It's raining hard!

11
00:01:12.426 --> 00:01:14.555
Where's Zippy?"

12
00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:22.804
"Zippy is stuck," said Eddy.

13
00:01:22.805 --> 00:01:35.764
He led Mr. Grill to Zippy.

14
00:01:35.765 --> 00:01:42.419
"Please help!" said Zippy.

15
00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:51.295
"Hold on," said Mr. Grill.

16
00:01:51.296 --> 00:01:58.918
Mr. Grill dropped his hook.

17
00:01:58.919 --> 00:02:03.024
Then he pulled Zippy out.

18
00:02:03.025 --> 00:02:09.585
"Thanks!" said Zippy.

19
00:02:09.586 --> 00:02:17.774
They drove back to school.

20
00:02:17.775 --> 00:02:21.929
Zoom! Zippy sped up.

21
00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:28.692
"Slow down!" called Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:28.693 --> 00:02:42.869
"Stop right there, Zippy!"

23
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:49.599
Eddy drove slowly past Zippy.

24
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.751
He crossed the finish line first!

25
00:02:52.752 --> 00:03:01.030
Eddy won the race!

